      <title>Linux nf_tables Use-After-Free Local Privilege Escalation (CVE-2024-1086)</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/poc-archive/pocs/binary/2026-05-17_linux-nftables-uaf-lpe/</link>
      <pubDate>Sun, 17 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
